        # ---------------------------
        # INTRODUCTION (STATIC)
        # ---------------------------
        story.append(Paragraph("<b>INTRODUCTION</b>", styles["Heading1"]))
        story.append(Spacer(1, 8))
        story.append(Paragraph("Modern control, optimization, and decision systems across aerospace, defense, energy, robotics, and computation are rarely governed by a single coherent dynamic. Instead, they are constructed as layered assemblies of independently designed mechanisms that must cooperate under uncertainty. These mechanisms include estimators to infer state, controllers to enforce stability, planners to chart future trajectories, optimizers to tune objectives, constraint handlers to maintain feasibility, safety monitors to prevent violations, regime selectors to switch behavior, schedulers to sequence execution, and disturbance models.", body))
        story.append(Spacer(1, 2))
        story.append(Paragraph("This architecture did not emerge from elegance but from necessity. Each classical component operates under narrow assumptions: estimators assume model fidelity, controllers assume locality or linearity, planners assume tractable foresight, and optimizers assume smooth objective structure. When these assumptions fail, additional layers are introduced, producing deeply layered stacks whose behavior can depend on tuning cascades, handoff thresholds, supervisory integration logic, and brittle switching boundaries.", body))
        story.append(Spacer(1, 2))
        story.append(Paragraph("As systems scale, this fragmentation becomes a dominant source of instability and opacity. Performance depends less on the underlying physics and more on the correctness of interconnections. Diagnosis becomes difficult, guarantees degrade across regimes, and small disturbances can cascade through the stack in unpredictable ways.", body))
        story.append(Spacer(1, 2))
        story.append(Paragraph("The Omni-Compass Unified Governing Convergence Control Core Engine was constructed to reduce fragmented supervisory arbitration by maintaining one persistent basin-driven governing state. It receives telemetry and manager proposals, evolves a bounded response, and returns coordinated directives through domain adapters, manager APIs, or direct operational actuators. Existing interfaces and specialized controls remain available where the operating environment requires them.", body))
        story.append(Spacer(1, 2))
        story.append(Paragraph("This report presents a runtime-verified evaluation of that claim. Through large-scale Monte Carlo execution, the engine is stress-tested across wide initial condition distributions and disturbance realizations. Stability, convergence, classification, and robustness are measured directly from execution rather than inferred from design assumptions. The following sections document that behavior and establish the feasibility of a single-engine governing core for traditional multi-stack architectures.", body))
        story.append(Spacer(1, 2))
        story.append(Paragraph("This document contains explicitly separated evidence layers. The governing-engine layer tests the canonical Piece I dynamics, numerical integration, conveyance, certification, regulation, and robustness. When executed, the vendor-neutral domain layers map the same engine into matched compute-infrastructure and fragmented-stack management simulations. Domain results remain bounded to the disclosed workload, hardware, power, thermal, manager, scheduler, and controller assumptions; they are not represented as live production-meter measurements or universal optimality.", compact_body))
        story.append(Spacer(1, 2))
        story.append(Paragraph(_html.escape(
            f"Operationally, Omni-Compass is a vendor-neutral nonlinear supervisory meta-controller and autonomic control plane above fragmented manager, software, and operational-muscle modules. Through domain adapters it can receive telemetry, proposals, constraints, and health signals from Kubernetes, Terraform, Datadog, Grafana, Kalman estimators, Adam optimizers, PID and model-predictive controllers, schedulers, safety monitors, robots, industrial plants, energy and aerospace systems, and other actuator layers. It does not replace their specialized mathematics; it supplies a common governing state that arbitrates competing commands, drives U toward the declared signed admissible interval under the explicit metric and projection rule, and applies bounded regulation to retain the acquired basin. In the recorded canonical execution, {summary.get('conveyed', 0)} of {summary.get('total', 0)} sampled trajectories met CONVEY-5 and {summary.get('certified_primary', summary.get('certified', 0))} met CERT-10 under the disclosed distribution and configuration. Those percentages are computed from executed trajectory histories and acceptance predicates, not hard-coded report text. Architectural novelty is presented as an owner assertion; independent prior-art review, external replication, live hardware evidence, and production validation remain separate requirements."
        ), intro_expansion_body))
