        ("Independent benefit surfaces","STACKS / CLUSTERS operational, computational, reliability, product/hardware, and accounting benefits are separable decision surfaces. Workforce reduction is never assumed, and aggregate benefit is allowed only after non-duplicative reconciliation."),
