# =============================================================================
# OMNI‑COMPASS ENTERPRISE EXECUTION LAYER (COMBINED SINGLE-FILE BUILD)
# =============================================================================
# This block adds CLI controls + deterministic seed override + config snapshot
# export + structured logging. It does NOT alter the core stepping equations.
